// 2026-09-17l: compiles, runs exit 0, prints got=6. TODAY logosc refuses with
//   error: 'llvm.getelementptr' op operand #0 must be LLVM pointer type or LLVM dialect-
//          compatible vector of LLVM pointer type
// — the same sentence as the match-door rows, from the same FACT: an aggregate PLACE reached by
// projection is handed to a GEP as a VALUE. `gen_for_each` takes its base from
